WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.429 --> 00:00:14.274
"Listen to me!"

2
00:00:14.594 --> 00:00:15.274
Venna shouted.

3
00:00:16.075 --> 00:00:17.576
But nobody was listening to her.

4
00:00:18.356 --> 00:00:20.297
The guards dragged the prisoners away.

5
00:00:21.698 --> 00:00:24.920
Zann started to rush forward, but Darb held him back.

6
00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:27.321
"Let them go," he whispered.

7
00:00:27.341 --> 00:00:29.842
"Otherwise the guards might grab you too."

8
00:00:31.223 --> 00:00:32.084
Zann sighed.

9
00:00:32.652 --> 00:00:33.993
He knew Darb was right.

10
00:00:34.913 --> 00:00:37.235
The guards had already taken his family away.

11
00:00:37.995 --> 00:00:39.676
There was nothing he could do right now.

12
00:00:40.917 --> 00:00:42.938
Laddno strode to the middle of the room.

13
00:00:43.918 --> 00:00:48.621
He whistled for attention, making the sound even louder with a Swelling spell.

14
00:00:49.721 --> 00:00:52.283
Everyone stopped talking and turned to stare at him.

15
00:00:52.303 --> 00:00:54.124
"Don't panic!"

16
00:00:54.364 --> 00:00:54.804
he shouted.

17
00:00:54.824 --> 00:00:58.106
"I'll get to the bottom of what's happening here, believe me."

18
00:00:58.126 --> 00:01:00.547
"Why should we believe you?"

19
00:01:00.827 --> 00:01:01.508
Venna snapped.

20
00:01:02.348 --> 00:01:04.029
"This is probably your fault.

21
00:01:04.570 --> 00:01:06.391
Everyone knows you're anti-Red."

22
00:01:07.212 --> 00:01:08.273
"That's not true."

23
00:01:08.593 --> 00:01:10.174
Laddno puffed out his chest.

24
00:01:10.194 --> 00:01:12.977
"I care about all of Magica's citizens.

25
00:01:13.737 --> 00:01:15.419
That's why I want to lead Magica."

26
00:01:16.519 --> 00:01:19.182
Laddno snapped his fingers and zapped out of sight.

27
00:01:20.082 --> 00:01:24.246
As soon as the businessman was gone, Zann broke free of Darb's grasp.

28
00:01:24.886 --> 00:01:26.027
He rushed toward Venna.

29
00:01:26.047 --> 00:01:27.768
"What's going on?"

30
00:01:27.969 --> 00:01:28.389
he cried.

31
00:01:28.409 --> 00:01:31.972
"Why did those guards take away my parents, Boz, and Teplo?"

32
00:01:32.852 --> 00:01:34.633
"Zann? What are you doing here?"

33
00:01:34.873 --> 00:01:37.473
Venna sounded surprised, and a little shaken.

34
00:01:38.334 --> 00:01:40.174
"Where did you kids come from?

35
00:01:40.854 --> 00:01:42.095
Never mind—it doesn't matter."

36
00:01:42.795 --> 00:01:43.375
She sighed.

37
00:01:43.395 --> 00:01:49.477
"Your parents and Boz were accused of stealing several important items from their lab.

38
00:01:50.357 --> 00:01:53.598
They're being held in the dungeon while the guards search their homes.

39
00:01:54.578 --> 00:01:57.659
Teplo tried to stop the arrest, so he's being held too."

40
00:01:58.999 --> 00:02:03.208
Zann gulped, immediately thinking about the guidelink.

41
00:02:03.228 --> 00:02:05.089
"Why are my parents being accused of stealing?"

42
00:02:05.189 --> 00:02:05.870
he blurted out.

43
00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:08.271
"I mean, it could have been anyone."

44
00:02:09.252 --> 00:02:10.693
Perda shot him a worried look.

45
00:02:11.393 --> 00:02:14.935
Zann guessed that all of his friends were thinking the same thing he was.

46
00:02:16.096 --> 00:02:17.797
This was all their fault!

47
00:02:18.617 --> 00:02:22.320
They had taken the guidelink, but Zann's family was in trouble for it.

48
00:02:24.501 --> 00:02:28.183
And the kids couldn't even give it back now, since Morb had taken it!

49
00:02:28.203 --> 00:02:32.069
"Yeah, who accused Zann's parents and Boz?"

50
00:02:32.329 --> 00:02:33.009
Perda put in.

51
00:02:33.029 --> 00:02:35.851
"There's no way to prove they took that thing."

52
00:02:35.871 --> 00:02:37.671
"What thing?"

53
00:02:37.951 --> 00:02:39.172
Venna looked confused.

54
00:02:39.192 --> 00:02:41.113
"The guidelink!"

55
00:02:41.333 --> 00:02:41.913
Gliss cried.

56
00:02:41.933 --> 00:02:44.494
"Zann's parents didn't steal it!"

57
00:02:45.194 --> 00:02:46.375
"What's a guidelink?"

58
00:02:46.975 --> 00:02:48.036
Venna shook her head.

59
00:02:48.056 --> 00:02:50.357
"Never mind, I don't care.

60
00:02:50.937 --> 00:02:54.999
Whatever it might be, the other items that are missing are much more important."

61
00:02:56.079 --> 00:02:58.120
"Huh?" Now Zann was confused.

62
00:02:58.872 --> 00:03:00.413
"What items are you talking about?

63
00:03:00.834 --> 00:03:01.994
What's missing from the lab?"

64
00:03:03.295 --> 00:03:04.836
"Several of the relics."

65
00:03:05.257 --> 00:03:06.537
Venna sounded grim.

66
00:03:06.557 --> 00:03:09.700
"Including the Mask of Zanta."

67
00:03:10.840 --> 00:03:11.761
Perda gasped.

68
00:03:12.301 --> 00:03:15.764
"Really? That's the most powerful relic there is!"

69
00:03:15.784 --> 00:03:21.307
"Yeah. But why would anyone think my parents would want to steal it?"

70
00:03:22.008 --> 00:03:23.349
Zann stared at Venna.

71
00:03:24.489 --> 00:03:27.892
"Now that I think about it, you were the one who didn't want the relics destroyed.

72
00:03:29.308 --> 00:03:30.529
Why didn't they accuse you?"

73
00:03:31.590 --> 00:03:34.132
Venna frowned at him, looking angry for a second.

74
00:03:34.833 --> 00:03:36.214
Then she sighed again.

75
00:03:36.234 --> 00:03:39.917
"Because I have an alibi," she said.

76
00:03:39.937 --> 00:03:43.581
"I was in a meeting at the palace when the relics disappeared.

77
00:03:44.521 --> 00:03:47.264
Otherwise, I'd probably be in the dungeon right now too."

78
00:03:47.284 --> 00:03:51.007
"Venna!" a woman called from across the room.

79
00:03:51.027 --> 00:03:52.468
"We need you!"

80
00:03:52.488 --> 00:03:54.850
"Coming!" Venna called back.

81
00:03:55.451 --> 00:03:56.372
She looked at the kids.

82
00:03:57.192 --> 00:04:00.433
"You four should lie low for the moment," she said quietly.

83
00:04:00.453 --> 00:04:04.975
"I'll get in touch when I figure out how to help the prisoners."

84
00:04:06.216 --> 00:04:06.976
She rushed away.

85
00:04:07.816 --> 00:04:11.558
Gliss looked around nervously before pulling the others into the hallway.

86
00:04:11.578 --> 00:04:14.579
"Venna's right," she whispered.

87
00:04:14.599 --> 00:04:16.380
"We should get out of here."

88
00:04:17.180 --> 00:04:18.541
Perda didn't seem to hear her.

89
00:04:18.561 --> 00:04:21.222
"Who would steal the Mask of Zanta?"

90
00:04:21.382 --> 00:04:21.822
she asked.

91
00:04:21.842 --> 00:04:23.623
"And why?"

92
00:04:23.863 --> 00:04:24.503
Zann added.

93
00:04:24.523 --> 00:04:29.518
"It's such a dangerous relic—the most ancient and powerful one in Magica."

94
00:04:30.318 --> 00:04:31.079
Perda nodded.

95
00:04:31.099 --> 00:04:34.260
"At least since the Horn of the Otherworld has been destroyed."

96
00:04:36.802 --> 00:04:39.684
Zann thought back to their last adventure and shuddered.

97
00:04:40.584 --> 00:04:45.987
Morb had stolen the Horn of the Otherworld and used it to give himself an incredible amount of

98
00:04:46.067 --> 00:04:49.229
power. Gliss seemed to be thinking the same thing.

99
00:04:49.249 --> 00:04:51.691
"What if Morb stole the mask?"

100
00:04:51.931 --> 00:04:53.652
she said, her eyes widening.

101
00:04:54.304 --> 00:04:56.886
"He might have made it back here to Magica before us."

102
00:04:58.147 --> 00:05:00.468
"He probably did," Perda agreed.

103
00:05:00.488 --> 00:05:04.171
"It took us a while, because he stole the guidelink from us."

104
00:05:05.091 --> 00:05:07.253
Zann glanced back into the throne room.

105
00:05:08.193 --> 00:05:11.396
Venna was huddled with Gliss' uncle and several other people.

106
00:05:12.016 --> 00:05:13.577
They all looked very serious.

107
00:05:13.597 --> 00:05:18.020
"We should have asked exactly when the relics went missing," he said.

108
00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:20.482
"Maybe we should ask Venna right now."

109
00:05:21.542 --> 00:05:22.423
Darb spoke up.

110
00:05:22.443 --> 00:05:23.764
"You heard what she said.

111
00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:25.861
She wants us to lie low."

112
00:05:25.881 --> 00:05:29.103
"But we should warn her," Zann said.

113
00:05:29.123 --> 00:05:33.146
"I mean, if Morb really is back, she should know, right?"

114
00:05:33.166 --> 00:05:37.669
"We don't know for sure that Morb is back," Gliss argued.

115
00:05:37.689 --> 00:05:43.553
"Maybe he—" Suddenly a Red popped into view from a nearby doorway.

116
00:05:43.573 --> 00:05:46.995
"Hey!" The man grabbed Gliss by the arm.

117
00:05:47.015 --> 00:05:48.817
"What did you kids just say?"

118
00:05:48.837 --> 00:05:53.660
"What?" Gliss tried to yank her arm away, but the man's grip was strong.

119
00:05:54.504 --> 00:05:55.265
"Let go of her!"

120
00:05:55.505 --> 00:05:56.105
Zann shouted.

121
00:05:56.126 --> 00:05:57.887
"Otherwise we'll call for help!"

122
00:05:58.547 --> 00:06:01.070
Zann was angry, but he was also confused.

123
00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:03.231
He had seen this man before.

124
00:06:03.852 --> 00:06:04.352
But where?

125
00:06:04.372 --> 00:06:07.935
"Hey, I know you," Darb blurted out.

126
00:06:07.955 --> 00:06:10.297
"We saw you at Zann's parents' lab."

127
00:06:11.078 --> 00:06:12.479
Darb glanced at his friends.

128
00:06:12.499 --> 00:06:15.882
"Remember?" Now Zann did remember.

129
00:06:16.862 --> 00:06:21.546
The man had been with Venna and the king and queen when they'd whisked his parents away to

130
00:06:21.566 --> 00:06:23.348
that important meeting on his birthday.

131
00:06:24.192 --> 00:06:27.074
Zann had thought the man looked familiar back then too.

132
00:06:28.535 --> 00:06:29.775
The man ignored Darb.

133
00:06:29.795 --> 00:06:35.579
"I heard you say my brother's name," he said, glaring at Gliss in an accusing way.

134
00:06:35.599 --> 00:06:38.140
"Why?" "Huh?"

135
00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:40.021
Gliss blinked in surprise.

136
00:06:40.041 --> 00:06:41.942
"What are you talking about?"

137
00:06:41.962 --> 00:06:44.264
"Yeah," Zann added.

138
00:06:44.284 --> 00:06:45.444
"Who's your brother?"

139
00:06:46.365 --> 00:06:48.846
The man turned and stared at him.

140
00:06:48.866 --> 00:06:51.948
"My brother is Morb."
